			"notes": "Allows for biomes to be manually registered with Highlands via a JSON file\n\nSomething like this:\n[\n {\n  \"id\":237,\n  \"weight\":4,\n  \"type\":\"hot\",\n  \"modName\":\"FakeMod\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\":237,\n  \"weight\":4,\n  \"type\":\"sub\",\n  \"parentId\", 203,\n  \"modName\":\"FakeMod\"\n }\n]\n\nValid biome types include hot, warm, cool, cold, ocean, & sub\n\nThe type \"sub\" specifies it is a sub biome and the element \"parentId\" is needed to specify which biome it is a sub of."
		},
